  "description": "After many years and miles are driven, the headlights on the average car or truck have been dimmed by abrasion from road debris, and yellowed and discolored from the sun and elements. A dim, cloudy, yellowed, or non-functioning headlight makes driving dangerous. Don’t risk your safety because of high dealer prices, you can get this Factory style headlight from YITAMOTO for much less. It’s the same as original equipment in fit, performance, and function.\nFitment\n2005-2007 Ford F-250 Super Duty models only\n2005-2007 Ford F-350 Super Duty models only\n2005-2007 Ford F-450 Super Duty models only\n2005-2007 Ford F-550 Super Duty models only\nDo not fit with the Sealed Beam Headlight model\n2005 Ford Excursion US models only\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nVehicle compatibility: headlights assembly compatible with 2005-2007 Ford F-250 F-350 F-450 F-550 Super Duty / 2005 Ford Excursion US models only; Not fit with sealed beam headlight model; high/low beam: H13; bulbs are not included\nWaterproof: fully sealed with solid silicon & designed with one-way vents to prevent moisture from being trapped inside the housing, no corrosion or moisture worries in sorts of weather conditions\nBrighter lighting: the metallic parabolic reflectors provide more light output to create a broader and smoother beam\nSafety reflector: the sided micro-prism reflector makes the oncoming cars or passerby quickly notice you at night, ensuring your driving safety and others'\nImpact resistance: the polycarbonate lens & tough housing are highly resistant to shock, vibration for any tough road; professional installation would be highly recommended",
